## 🔐 SECURITY REQUIREMENTS (MANDATORY)

1. NEVER trust client-side data.

2. Validate ALL inputs (backend required).

3. Enforce role-based access:

   * छात्र (student) cannot access vendor APIs
   * vendor cannot access other vendor data

4. Use authentication (Firebase Auth or equivalent).

5. Protect database rules:

   * Users can only access their own orders
   * Vendors can only access their own orders

6. Prevent:

   * price tampering
   * order spoofing
   * unauthorized status updates

7. Use server-side validation for:

   * total price calculation
   * pickup time validation
   * order creation

