* name
* role (student/vendor/admin)

Vendors:

* id
* name
* prep_capacity (max concurrent orders)
* is_open

MenuItems:

* id
* vendor_id
* name
* price
* prep_time
* is_available

Orders:

* id
* user_id
* vendor_id
* items[]
* total_price (computed server-side)
* pickup_time
* status (pending/preparing/ready/completed)
* created_at

